+
+It identifies the exact manifest, whose entries in turn identify every suite
+file. It is not a hash of a directory, a git tree, a release tag, or an
+implementation's private golden files. Before accepting a claim, a verifier
+must match the claim digest to the released manifest and verify the manifest's
+closed inventory and every listed file digest. A matching manifest digest
+without verified entries is insufficient suite evidence.
 
